- "UPDATE": a genuinely new development of a KNOWN story that adds a material NEW fact: a new version/release/patch of that product, a release or launch date, a launch actually happening, pricing or licensing change, new platform/engine support, a new game or studio adopting it, open weights released, new benchmark numbers. Set story_id and update_note.
